[FINAL-TEXT] **Phase 5 — Evidence is conclusive.** Here is the complete picture:

| Evidence | Value |
|---|---|
| `r3.eth0` operstate | **DOWN** (no UP/RUNNING flags, `state DOWN`) |
| `r9.eth0` (peer on domain J) | UP, 39.1.1.2/8 — peer is healthy |
| dmesg on r3 | **empty** — no flap events, no repeated transitions |
